{"id": 11131, "url": "https://www.camplife.com/campground/Hells+Canyon+Area+-+Copperfield+Park", "read": "2026-10-14", "ref": ["name", "Hells+Canyon+Area+-+Copperfield+Park"], "record": {"images": [{"id": 1543421, "url": "https://s3.amazonaws.com/sunriseimages-prod/static-app-content/cgs/557/images/gallery/1_b.jpg", "contentType": "image", "primary": false, "caption": "", "textSummary": "Campground image 1"}, {"id": 1549896, "url": "https://s3.amazonaws.com/sunriseimages-prod/static-app-content/cgs/557/images/gallery/2_b.jpg", "contentType": "image", "primary": false, "caption": "", "textSummary": "Campground image 2"}, {"id": 1549897, "url": "https://s3.amazonaws.com/sunriseimages-prod/static-app-content/cgs/557/images/gallery/3_b.jpg", "contentType": "image", "primary": false, "caption": "", "textSummary": "Campground image 3"}, {"id": 1549898, "url": "https://s3.amazonaws.com/sunriseimages-prod/static-app-content/cgs/557/images/gallery/4_b.jpg", "contentType": "image", "primary": false, "caption": "", "textSummary": "Campground image 4"}], "campgroundId": 557, "hasOnlineStore": true, "campgroundName": "Hells Canyon Area - Copperfield Park", "primaryAddress": {"address1": "Oregon Hwy 86", "address2": null, "city": "Oxbow", "stateProvince": "OR", "zipCode": "97840"}, "phone": null, "email": "questions@idahopower.com", "lat": "44.9732", "lon": "-116.856729", "facebookUrl": "https://www.facebook.com/idahopower/", "twitterId": "idahopower", "pinterestUrl": null, "instagramUrl": "https://www.instagram.com/idahopower/", "description": "<p><em></em></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p>Campgrounds fill up quickly. Reservations are strongly encouraged to ensure you will have a spot when you arrive.</p><p>\n</p><p>Please enjoy the outdoors safely, and remember to wear a safety vest when recreating in, on or around the water!</p><p>Camp host is on site early April until Labor Day</p><p><a href=\"https://www.idahopower.com/community-recreation/recreation/parks-and-campgrounds/copperfield-park/\">Copperfield Park</a> includes 12 acres of manicured lawn, paved roads, terraced landscaping and numerous trees. Get the latest stream flow and reservoir water level <a href=\"https://www.idahopower.com/recreation/water-information/\">information</a>.<br></p><p>Day use in the park is free.<br></p><p></p><ul><li>59 RV sites with water and electric hookups (30-amp)\n</li><li>10 tent sites with shared water\n</li><li>Picnic area with tables\n</li><li>Fire rings\n</li><li>Additional vehicle and boat trailer parking available\n</li><li>Public pay phone (phone card required for non-local calls)\n</li><li>Boat launch and docks located approximately one-half mile downstream of the park, on Homestead Road\n</li></ul><p></p><p>Road status: Call <a href=\"tel:541-785-7251\">541-785-7251</a> to get a recorded status update about the road condition between Oxbow and Hells Canyon Dam. This is road is sometimes closed due to maintenance or road conditions.\n</p><p><strong>Fees\n</strong></p><p>Campsite Fees\n</p><p><strong>Year-round Rates</strong></p><blockquote>RV site $35/night<br>\nTent site $20/night\n</blockquote><p>\n</p><p><strong>Reservation Fees</strong><br></p><blockquote>Online $7/site<br>\nPhone $15/site – call <a href=\"tel:1-844-472-7275\">1-844-472-7275</a> to make a reservation</blockquote><p>Applicable state taxes will be added to all fees. Reservation fee is non-refundable.\n</p><p><strong>Cancellations\n</strong></p><p>If a reservation is canceled 14 days or more prior to the scheduled arrival date, the camping fee will be refunded minus a $10 cancellation charge. If a reservation is canceled 13 days or less prior to the arrival date, the camping fee will be refunded minus a $10 cancellation charge and the first night’s camping fee.</p><p>Follow these steps to cancel a reservation:\n</p><p></p><ul><li>Log in to the <a href=\"https://www.camplife.com/idaho_power\">reservation system</a> and click account/profile name, or\n</li><li>Call <a href=\"tel:1-844-472-7275\">1-844-472-7275</a>\n</li></ul><p></p><p>Note: The reservation fee is non-refundable; in addition, a cancellation fee of $10 will apply.\n</p><p>View more information on <a href=\"https://www.idahopower.com/recreation/about-parks-and-campgrounds/fees/\">fees, changes and cancellations</a>.\n</p><p><strong>Rules\n</strong></p><p>There is a 14-day stay limit for all parks.\n</p><p>Check-in time is 2 p.m. MDT (local park time).\n</p><p>Check-out time is 1 p.m. MDT (local park time).\n</p><p>Only one camping unit (maximum eight persons) per designated campsite is permitted.\n</p><p>A person may reserve no more than five (5) sites at one campground on the same dates. If more sites are needed, additional reservations must be made by a different person.</p><p>View our <a href=\"https://www.idahopower.com/recreation/about-parks-and-campgrounds/policies/\">policies</a>.\n</p><p><strong>More Information\n</strong></p><p>Get more information about other <a href=\"https://www.idahopower.com/community-recreation/recreation/parks-and-campgrounds/\">Idaho Power parks and campgrounds</a>.\n</p><p>Contact Idaho Power:<br></p><p><a href=\"mailto:questions@idahopower.com\">questions@idahopower.com</a></p><p></p><p></p>", "events": "<div><span style=\"font-size: regular;\"><a href=\"https://www.camplife.com/reservation/landingPageHandler?campgroundName=Idaho+Power\">Reservation System</a></span></div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://www.idahopower.com/recreation/about-parks-and-campgrounds/frequently-asked-questions/\">Frequently Asked Questions</a>&nbsp;<br><p><br></p><p><br></p></div>"}, "cg": 557, "name": "Hells Canyon Area - Copperfield Park", "currency": "", "config": {"siteTypes": [{"id": 101, "name": "Back-in", "equipTypeIds": [8, 9, 6, 3, 1, 7, 12], "amenityIds": [7, 91, 66, 232, 24, 244, 10]}, {"id": 100, "name": "Pull Through", "equipTypeIds": [8, 9, 6, 3, 1, 7, 12], "amenityIds": [7, 91, 66, 232, 24, 244, 10]}, {"id": 4, "name": "Tent", "equipTypeI